  "description": "Celebrate the holidays with this adorable Christmas Pattern! A seamless digital paper featuring cute Christmas gnomes, gingerbread men, candy canes, stockings, gifts, holly berries, pine branches and snowflakes on a clean white background.\nWHAT YOU GET:\n• 1 JPG file (JPG only)\n• 300 DPI high resolution\n• 12 × 12 inches seamless digital paper\nDESIGN THEME:\nA cheerful red, green and white Christmas pattern with smiling gnomes holding gifts, happy gingerbread cookies, striped candy canes, snowflake stockings, wrapped presents, holly leaves and pinecones — perfect for a cozy festive look.\nPERFECT FOR:\nChristmas wrapping paper, scrapbooking, greeting cards, invitations, gift tags, fabric and textile design, wall art, home decor, planners, stickers, and holiday party decorations.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Celebrate the holidays with this adorable Christmas Pattern! A seamless digital paper featuring cute Christmas gnomes, gingerbread men, candy canes, stockings, gifts, holly berries, pine branches and snowflakes on a clean white background.</p>\n<p>WHAT YOU GET:<br>\n• 1 JPG file (JPG only)<br>\n• 300 DPI high resolution<br>\n• 12 × 12 inches seamless digital paper</p>\n<p>DESIGN THEME:<br>\nA cheerful red, green and white Christmas pattern with smiling gnomes holding gifts, happy gingerbread cookies, striped candy canes, snowflake stockings, wrapped presents, holly leaves and pinecones — perfect for a cozy festive look.</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR:<br>\nChristmas wrapping paper, scrapbooking, greeting cards, invitations, gift tags, fabric and textile design, wall art, home decor, planners, stickers, and holiday party decorations.</p>",
